<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
aggregate purchase price associated with the two Divestitures was $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferred1_pn5n6_c20250101__20251231__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--CoflexCoFixAgreementMember__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--CompanionSpineLlcMember_z8v3XZorK1Ek" title="total purchase price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferred1" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_custom_CoflexCoFixAgreementMember_custom_CompanionSpineLlcMember" id="Fact000703" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">21.4</ix:nonFraction></span> million.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company determined that the Divestitures do not meet the criteria for classification as discontinued operations for
accounting purposes. As a result, all historical operating results for the Coflex/CoFix assets and international hardware business
are reflected within the consolidated statements of operations in the consolidated financial statements.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company recognized a gain on sale of $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--GainOrLossOnSaleOfStockInSubsidiary_pn5n6_c20250101__20251231__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--CoflexCoFixAgreementMember__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--CompanionSpineLlcMember_zdGRcY1dJcO5" title="Gain on sale of divestitures"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:GainOrLossOnSaleOfStockInSubsidiary" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_custom_CoflexCoFixAgreementMember_custom_CompanionSpineLlcMember" id="Fact000705" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">3.3</ix:nonFraction></span> million in connection with the Divestitures during the year ended December 31, 2025. The gain
on sale included the divestiture of $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--AccumulatedOtherComprehensiveIncomeLossForeignCurrencyTranslationAdjustmentNetOfTax_iI_pn5n6_c20251201__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--CoflexCoFixAgreementMember__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--CompanionSpineLlcMember_zt5pVqobOT9e" title="Accumulated other comprehensive income from currency translation adjustment"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AccumulatedOtherComprehensiveIncomeLossForeignCurrencyTranslationAdjustmentNetOfTax" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-01_custom_CoflexCoFixAgreementMember_custom_CompanionSpineLlcMember" id="Fact000707" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.4</ix:nonFraction></span> million accumulated other comprehensive income from currency translation adjustment recorded
through December 1, 2025. Goodwill of $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationGoodwillCurrent_iI_pn5n6_c20251231__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--CoflexCoFixAgreementMember__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--CompanionSpineLlcMember_z9sftBMg202g" title="Goodwill"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationGoodwillCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_custom_CoflexCoFixAgreementMember_custom_CompanionSpineLlcMember" id="Fact000709" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.2</ix:nonFraction></span> million was allocated to the disposal group based on the relative fair values of the divested
assets and liabilities and retained assets and liabilities. The assets and liabilities of the disposal group at the December 1, 2025
date of sale and at December 31, 2024 were:</span></p>

