of December 31, 2025, the weighted average remaining contractual term of outstanding warrants was <span id="xdx_904_ecustom--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentNonOptionsOutstandingAndExercisableWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm_dtY_c20250101__20251231__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--WarrantMember_zY5zbCLZEe14" title="Weighted average remaining contractual term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-012025-12-31_us-gaap_WarrantMember7304968" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact001204" name="XTNT:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentNonOptionsOutstandingAndExercisableWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm">0.8</ix:nonNumeric></span> years.</span></p>

