Jain and Tyler Lipschultz were appointed to our Board effective as of August 1, 2025 at the request of Nantahala and upon a determination
by our Board that their appointment and the resulting Board composition is in the best interests of the Company and our stockholders.
There is no investor rights agreement or other arrangements between us and Nantahala regarding board composition or other governance
