RSU or DSU awards were granted to all of our non-employee directors, with an additional award granted to Mr. Vizirgianakis in consideration
of his Chairman of the Board role and to recognize the significant time and effort he dedicated to Board matters during 2025. Because
we use a 30-day volume weighted average price of our common stock to determine the number of RSUs or DSUs to grant, the grant date fair
value of these awards may be different than the value we used in determining the number of RSUs or DSUs. Consistent with our equity grant
policy, these equity grants were granted on November 15, 2025, the 15<sup>th</sup> date of the month following corporate approval of
the awards.</span></p>

